": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift", "description": "Lift a functor `F : C \u2964 D` to `with_term C \u2964 D`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.is_iso_of_to_star", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_to_initial_unique", "description": "A variant of `lift_unique` with `Z` an initial object.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.quiver.hom.unique", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_to_initial_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift_to_terminal_unique_inv_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.incl.category_theory.full", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.incl_lift", "description": "The isomorphism between `incl \u22d9 lift F _ _` with `F`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_to_initial_unique_inv_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.incl.category_theory.faithful", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_obj", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.incl_lift_to_initial", "description": "A variant of `incl_lift` with `Z` an initial object.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift_unique", "description": "The uniqueness of `lift`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_to_initial_unique_hom_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.incl_lift", "description": "The isomorphism between `incl \u22d9 lift F _ _` with `F`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift_to_terminal_unique", "description": "A variant of `lift_unique` with `Z` a terminal object.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_star_lift_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal", "description": "Formally adjoin a terminal object to a category.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.of", "description": "Formally adjoin a terminal object to a category.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.star", "description": "Formally adjoin a terminal object to a category.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.category_theory.category", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.lift_star_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.is_iso_of_from_star", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_terminal.hom", "description": "Morphisms for `with_terminal C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.hom", "description": "Morphisms for `with_initial C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.with_initial.lift_star_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.affine_open_cover_tfae", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.target_affine_locally_pullback_fst_of_right_of_stable_under_base_change", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.stable_under_base_change", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.affine_target_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.affine_open_cover_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local", "description": "We say that `P : affine_target_morphism_property` is a local property if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for any\n  global section `r`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for all `r` in a spanning set of the global sections,\n  then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.respects_iso", "description": "We say that `P : affine_target_morphism_property` is a local property if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for any\n  global section `r`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for all `r` in a spanning set of the global sections,\n  then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.to_basic_open", "description": "We say that `P : affine_target_morphism_property` is a local property if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for any\n  global section `r`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for all `r` in a spanning set of the global sections,\n  then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.of_basic_open_cover", "description": "We say that `P : affine_target_morphism_property` is a local property if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for any\n  global section `r`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ Y.basic_open r` for all `r` in a spanning set of the global sections,\n  then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.respects_iso_mk", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.target_affine_locally_is_local", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.to_property", "description": " A `affine_target_morphism_property` can be extended to a `morphism_property` such that it\n*never* holds when the target is not affine", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target.open_cover_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.affine_target_is_iso", "description": "`is_iso` as an `affine_morphism_property`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.diagonal_of_target_affine_locally", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.target_affine_locally_respects_iso", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.universally_is_local_at_target_of_morphism_restrict", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.diagonal_target_affine_locally_eq_target_affine_locally", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.diagonal_affine_open_cover_tfae", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.is_iso", "description": "`is_iso` as a `morphism_property`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.to_property_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target", "description": "We say that `P : morphism_property Scheme` is local at the target if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for any `U`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for an open cover `U` of `Y`, then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target.respects_iso", "description": "We say that `P : morphism_property Scheme` is local at the target if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for any `U`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for an open cover `U` of `Y`, then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target.restrict", "description": "We say that `P : morphism_property Scheme` is local at the target if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for any `U`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for an open cover `U` of `Y`, then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target.of_open_cover", "description": "We say that `P : morphism_property Scheme` is local at the target if\n1. `P` respects isomorphisms.\n2. If `P` holds for `f : X \u27f6 Y`, then `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for any `U`.\n3. If `P` holds for `f \u2223_ U` for an open cover `U` of `Y`, then `P` holds for `f`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.property_is_local_at_target.open_cover_tfae", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.morphism_property.topologically", "description": "`topologically P` holds for a morphism if the underlying topological map satisfies `P`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.stable_under_base_change", "description": " A `P : affine_target_morphism_property` is stable under base change if `P` holds for `Y \u27f6 S`\nimplies that `P` holds for `X \u00d7\u209b Y \u27f6 X` with `X` and `S` affine schemes.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.is_local.diagonal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property", "description": " An `affine_target_morphism_property` is a class of morphisms from an arbitrary scheme into an\naffine scheme.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.affine_target_morphism_property.diagonal", "description": "The `affine_target_morphism_property` associated to `(target_affine_locally P).diagonal`.\nSee `diagonal_target_affine_locally_