ime `\u03c4` describes some stopping rule such that at time\n`i`, we may determine it with the information we have at time `i`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.condexp_stopping_time_ae_eq_restrict_eq_of_countable", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.prog_measurable.stopped_process", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.condexp_min_stopping_time_ae_eq_restrict_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.stopped_value", "description": " Given a map `u : \u03b9 \u2192 \u03a9 \u2192 E`, its stopped value with respect to the stopping\ntime `\u03c4` is the map `x \u21a6 u (\u03c4 \u03c9) \u03c9`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt_of_countable'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_ge_of_countable'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_space_le_of_le_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.stopped_process_eq_of_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.max_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.max", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.stopped_value_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt_of_pred", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt_of_is_lub", "description": "Auxiliary lemma for `is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_min_const_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.adapted.stopped_process_of_discrete", "description": " If the indexing order has the discrete topology, then the stopped process of an adapted process\nis adapted.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_space_min_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_inter_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.piecewise_of_le", "description": " Given stopping times `\u03c4` and `\u03b7` which are bounded below, `set.piecewise s \u03c4 \u03b7` is also\na stopping time with respect to the same filtration.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_ge'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_lt_of_countable", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.condexp_stopping_time_ae_eq_restrict_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_of_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.mem_\u2112p_stopped_value", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.condexp_min_stopping_time_ae_eq_restrict_le_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_eq_of_countable", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_le'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.adapted.strongly_measurable_stopped_process", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.prog_measurable.adapted_stopped_process", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.sigma_finite_stopping_time", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.is_stopping_time.measurable_set_inter_le_const_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measur