y operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.sup", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.lt", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_refl", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_trans", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.lt_iff_le_not_le", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_antisymm", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_sup_left", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_sup_right", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.sup_le", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.inf", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.inf_le_left", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.inf_le_right", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_inf", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.top", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.himp", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_top", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_heyting_algebra.le_himp_iff", "description": " A generalized Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary operation `\u21e8` called\nHeyting implication such that `a \u21e8` is right adjoint to `a \u2293`.\n\n This generalizes `heyting_algebra` by not requiring a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "punit.biheyting_algebra", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "top_himp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "hnot_hnot_sdiff_distrib", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "snd_himp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_himp_iff_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "compl_le_compl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sup_sdiff_cancel'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_le.le.codisjoint_hnot_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "heyting_algebra.of_himp", "description": "Construct a Heyting algebra from the lattice structure and Heyting implication alone.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sdiff_sdiff_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "compl_le_himp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "disjoint_compl_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sdiff_triangle", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "prod.has_compl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sup_sdiff_right_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_compl_iff_disjoint_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_hnot", "description": " Syntax typeclass for Heyting negation `\uffe2`.\n\nThe difference between `has_compl` and `has_hnot` is that the former belongs to Heyting algebras,\nwhile the latter belongs to co-Heyting algebras. They are both pseudo-complements, but `compl`\nunderestimates while `hnot` overestimates. In boolean algebras, they are equal. See `hnot_eq_compl`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_hnot.hnot", "description": " Syntax typeclass for Heyting negation `\uffe2`.\n\nThe difference between `has_compl` and `has_hnot` is that the former belongs to Heyting algebras,\nwhile the latter belongs to co-Heyting algebras. They are both pseudo-complements, but `compl`\nunderestimates while `hnot` overestimates. In boolean algebras, they are equal. See `hnot_eq_compl`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.sup", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.le", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.lt", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.le_refl", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.le_trans", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.lt_iff_le_not_le", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.le_antisymm", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coheyting_algebra.le_sup_left", "description": " A co-Heyting algebra is a bounded  lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u229