o `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.lt", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.le_refl", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.le_trans", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.lt_iff_le_not_le", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.le_antisymm", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.le_sup_left", "description": " A generalized co-Heyting algebra is a lattice with an additional binary difference operation `\\`\nsuch that `\\ a` is right adjoint to `\u2294 a`.\n\nThis generalizes `coheyting_algebra` by not requiring a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "generalized_coheyting_algebra.le_sup