en affine cover to form a affine cover that is also\na basis.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.lift_fac", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.morphism_restrict_\u03b9_assoc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.morphism_restrict", "description": "The restriction of a morphism `X \u27f6 Y` onto `X |_{f \u207b\u00b9 U} \u27f6 Y |_ U`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.open_cover.finite_subcover_obj", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.morphism_restrict_val_base", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.open_cover.add_f", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.open_cover.inter", "description": "Given open covers `{ U\u1d62 }` and `{ U\u2c7c }`, we may form the open cover `{ U\u1d62 \u2229 U\u2c7c }`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.forget_preserves_of_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.open_cover.add", "description": "Adding an open immersion into an open cover gives another open cover.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.app_eq_inv_app_app_of_comp_eq", "description": "The `fg` argument is to avoid nasty stuff about dependent types.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_Scheme_hom", "description": "If `X \u27f6 Y` is an open immersion of PresheafedSpaces, and `Y` is a Scheme, we can\nupgrade it into a morphism of Schemes.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.pullback_to_base", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.forget_preserves_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.Scheme.of_restrict_val_base", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.is_open_immersion.has_pullback_of_left", "d