o known as **Chebyshev's first inequality**.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_max", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_finset_sum_measure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_mul_const'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.supr\u2082_lintegral_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.set_lintegral_dirac", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_bUnion_finset\u2080", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_mono_set'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "measure_theory.lintegral_inter_add_diff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "partial_order", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.le", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.lt", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.le_refl", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.le_trans", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.lt_iff_le_not_le", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "partial_order.le_antisymm", "description": "A partial order is a reflexive, transitive, antisymmetric relation `\u2264`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "preorder.to_has_lt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_iff_lt_or_eq", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_refl", "description": "The relation `\u2264` on a preorder is reflexive.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "decidable.eq_or_lt_of_le", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_trans", "description": "The relation `\u2264` on a preorder is transitive.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_of_eq", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_by_cases", "description": "Perform a case-split on the ordering of `x` and `y` in a decidable linear order.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_or_gt_of_ne", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_of_not_ge", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "not_lt_of_gt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_iff_not_ge", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_or_lt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "ge_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_of_le_of_ne", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_le.le.is_total_preorder", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "not_le_of_gt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_of_not_ge", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "ne_of_gt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "is_strict_weak_order_of_linear_order", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "eq_or_lt_of_not_lt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "gt_of_ge_of_gt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "max_default", "description": "Default definition of `max`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "gt_of_gt_of_ge", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_iff_le_not_le", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "ne_iff_lt_or_gt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_asymm", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "le_of_eq_or_lt", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_le.le.decidable", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "gt_irrefl", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "decidable.lt_or_eq_of_le", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "not_lt_of_ge", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "decidable_lt_of_decidable_le", "description": "`<` is decidable if `\u2264` is.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lt_trich