f_le`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.map_inf_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.subset_union_prime", "description": "Prime avoidance. Atiyah-Macdonald 1.11, Eisenbud 3.3, Stacks 00DS, Matsumura Ex.1.6.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.mem_map_iff_of_surjective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.bot_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.comap_map_of_surjective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ideal.radical_le_radical_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_coe_t_aux", "description": "Auxiliary transitive closure for `has_coe` which does not contain\n  instances such as `coe_option`.\n\n  They would produce non-termination when combined with `coe_fn_trans` and `coe_sort_trans`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_t_aux.coe", "description": "Auxiliary transitive closure for `has_coe` which does not contain\n  instances such as `coe_option`.\n\n  They would produce non-termination when combined with `coe_fn_trans` and `coe_sort_trans`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_base_aux", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_to_lift", "description": "Every coercion is also a lift", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_t", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_b", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe.coe", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_fn", "description": "Remark: we can't use `[has_lift_t a\u2082 a\u2081]` since it will produce non-termination whenever a type class resolution\n  problem does not have a solution.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_sort_bool", "description": "Tactics such as the simplifier only unfold reducible constants when checking whether two terms are definitionally\n  equal or a term is a proposition. The motivation is performance.\n  In particular, when simplifying `p -> q`, the tactic `simp` only visits `p` if it can establish that it is a proposition.\n  Thus, we mark the following instance as `@[reducible]`, otherwise `simp` will not visit `\u2191p` when simplifying `\u2191p -> q`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_pair\u2081", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_pair", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_fn", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_to_sort", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_to_sort.coe", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_t", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_sort_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_decidable_eq", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_to_fun", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_to_fun.coe", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_fn_dom", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_subtype", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_base", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_pair\u2082", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_fn_trans", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_t", "description": "Auxiliary class that contains the transitive closure of `has_coe`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_coe_t.coe", "description": "Auxiliary class that contains the transitive closure of `has_coe`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_lift", "description": "Can perform a lifting operation `\u2191a`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_lift.lift", "description": "Can perform a lifting operation `\u2191a`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_fn_b", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_base", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_sort", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_lift_t", "description": "Auxiliary class that contains the transitive closure of `has_lift`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "has_lift_t.lift", "description": "Auxiliary class that contains the transitive closure of `has_lift`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_fn_range", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_pi_range", "description": "A dependent version of `lift_fn_range`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "lift_list", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_option", "description": "We add this instance directly into `has_coe_t` to avoid non-termination.\n\n  Suppose coe_option had type `(has_coe a (option a))`.\n  Then, we can loop when searching a coercion from `\u03b1` to `\u03b2` `(has_coe_t \u03b1 \u03b2)`\n  1. `coe_trans at (has_coe_t \u03b1 \u03b2)`\n         `(has_coe \u03b1 ?b\u2081) and (has_coe_t ?b\u2081 c)`\n  2. `coe_option at (has_coe \u03b1 ?b\u2081)`\n         `?b\u2081 := option \u03b1`\n  3. `coe_trans at (has_coe_t (option \u03b1) \u03b2)`\n         `(has_coe (option \u03b1) ?b\u2082) and (has_coe_t ?b\u2082 \u03b2)`\n  4. `coe_option at (has_coe (option \u03b1) ?b\u2082)`\n         `?b\u2082 := option (option \u03b1))`\n  ...", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_trans_aux", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "coe_bool_to_Prop", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_dedup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_cons", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_dedup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_ndunion", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_union", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.le_sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.sup_union", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "multiset.inf_ndinsert", "description": "", "p": "mathlib