quaternion_algebra.basis", "description": " A quaternion basis contains the information both sufficient and necessary to construct an\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to `A`; or equivalently, a surjective\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to an `R`-subalgebra of `A`.\n\nNote that for definitional convenience, `k` is provided as a field even though `i_mul_j` fully\ndetermines it.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "quaternion_algebra.basis.i", "description": " A quaternion basis contains the information both sufficient and necessary to construct an\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to `A`; or equivalently, a surjective\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to an `R`-subalgebra of `A`.\n\nNote that for definitional convenience, `k` is provided as a field even though `i_mul_j` fully\ndetermines it.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "quaternion_algebra.basis.j", "description": " A quaternion basis contains the information both sufficient and necessary to construct an\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to `A`; or equivalently, a surjective\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to an `R`-subalgebra of `A`.\n\nNote that for definitional convenience, `k` is provided as a field even though `i_mul_j` fully\ndetermines it.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "quaternion_algebra.basis.k", "description": " A quaternion basis contains the information both sufficient and necessary to construct an\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to `A`; or equivalently, a surjective\n`R`-algebra homomorphism from `\u210d[R,c\u2081,c\u2082]` to an `R`-subalgebra of `A`.\n\nNote that for definitional convenience, `k` is provided as a field even though `i_mul_j` fully\ndetermines it.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "quaternion_algebra.basis.i_mul_i", "description": " A quaternion basis contains the information both sufficient and necessary to construct an\n`R`