", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_eq_bind", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto_congr'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.generate_Union", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_le.mul_le_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.Inf_ne_bot_of_directed'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.mem_inf_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.sequence_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.mem_inf_of_inter", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.nontrivial", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.eq_on.eventually_eq_of_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.mem_comap_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_all_finset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.principal_eq_iff_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.mem_supr", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.sup_principal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto", "description": "`tendsto` is the generic \"limit of a function\" predicate.\n `tendsto f l\u2081 l\u2082` asserts that for every `l\u2082` neighborhood `a`,\n the `f`-preimage of `a` is an `l\u2081` neighborhood.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_inf", "description": "The infimum of filters is the filter generated by intersections\n of elements of the two filters.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_eq.fun_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_eq.sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_and", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.alternative", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.disjoint_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.filter_eq_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.infi_ne_bot_iff_of_d