u03b1`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `\u03b1`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.univ_sets", "description": " A filter `F` on a type `\u03b1` is a collection of sets of `\u03b1` which contains the whole `\u03b1`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `\u03b1`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.sets_of_superset", "description": " A filter `F` on a type `\u03b1` is a collection of sets of `\u03b1` which contains the whole `\u03b1`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `\u03b1`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.inter_sets", "description": " A filter `F` on a type `\u03b1` is a collection of sets of `\u03b1` which contains the whole `\u03b1`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `\u03b1`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.ne_bot.mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.le_seq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.frequently_supr", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.infi_principal_finite", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_eq.mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually_eq.diff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto_infi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.frequently_or_distrib_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto_of_is_empty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.inf_eq_bot_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.map_infi_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.comap_supr", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.infi_eq_generate", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"