64 y` on pre-games built using the constructor.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.relabel", "description": "Replace the types indexing the next moves for Left and Right by equivalent types.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.fuzzy.is_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.has_add", "description": "The sum of `x = {xL | xR}` and `y = {yL | yR}` is `{xL + y, x + yL | xR + y, x + yR}`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.lt_congr_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.lt_of_lt_of_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.to_of_lists_right_moves", "description": "Converts a number into a right move for `of_lists`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.star", "description": "The pre-game `star`, which is fuzzy with zero.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.le_iff_sub_nonneg", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.zero_equiv_neg_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.lf.not_equiv'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.lf.not_ge", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.zero_le_of_is_empty_right_moves", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.move_left", "description": "The new game after Left makes an allowed move.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.neg_zero_class", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.relabelling.sub_congr", "description": " If `w` has the same moves as `x` and `y` has the same moves as `z`,\nthen `w - y` has the same moves as `x - z`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.le_neg_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.to_left_moves_add", "description": " Converts a left move for `x` or `y` into a left move for `x + y` and vice versa.\n\nEven though these types are the same (not definitionally so), this is the preferred way to convert\nbetween them.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.zero_right_moves", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.fuzzy_of_fuzzy_of_equiv", "description": "", "