ith two arguments.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring", "description": " A non-unital subsemiring of a non-unital semiring `R` is a subset `s` that is both an additive\nsubmonoid and a semigroup.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.carrier", "description": " A non-unital subsemiring of a non-unital semiring `R` is a subset `s` that is both an additive\nsubmonoid and a semigroup.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.add_mem'", "description": " A non-unital subsemiring of a non-unital semiring `R` is a subset `s` that is both an additive\nsubmonoid and a semigroup.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.zero_mem'", "description": " A non-unital subsemiring of a non-unital semiring `R` is a subset `s` that is both an additive\nsubmonoid and a semigroup.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.mul_mem'", "description": " A non-unital subsemiring of a non-unital semiring `R` is a subset `s` that is both an additive\nsubmonoid and a semigroup.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.mk'", "description": " Construct a `non_unital_subsemiring R` from a set `s`, a subsemigroup `sg`, and an additive\nsubmonoid `sa` such that `x \u2208 s \u2194 x \u2208 sg \u2194 x \u2208 sa`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.mem_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_ring_hom.srange_top_of_surjective", "description": "The range of a surjective non-unital ring homomorphism is the whole of the codomain.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.mem_closure_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.coe_mk'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.closure_eq", "description": "Closure of a non-unital subsemiring `S` equals `S`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_subsemiring.to_add_submonoid_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_ring_hom.eq_slocus", "description": "The n