08 l` if and only if `t` includes `s i` for some `i` such that `p i`, and the set\ndefined by `p` is countable.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_countable_basis.to_has_basis", "description": " We say that a filter `l` has a countable basis `s : \u03b9 \u2192 set \u03b1` bounded by `p : \u03b9 \u2192 Prop`,\nif `t \u2208 l` if and only if `t` includes `s i` for some `i` such that `p i`, and the set\ndefined by `p` is countable.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_countable_basis.countable", "description": " We say that a filter `l` has a countable basis `s : \u03b9 \u2192 set \u03b1` bounded by `p : \u03b9 \u2192 Prop`,\nif `t \u2208 l` if and only if `t` includes `s i` for some `i` such that `p i`, and the set\ndefined by `p` is countable.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.frequently_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.eq_infi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_binfi_principal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_countably_generated_of_seq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.countable_binfi_eq_infi_seq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_infi'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.mem_iff", "description": "Definition of `has_basis` unfolded with implicit set argument.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.to_has_basis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_infi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.forall_mem_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.prod_same_index_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.antitone_seq_of_seq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_basis.mem_filter_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.exists_antitone_basis", "description": "A countably generated filter admits a basis formed by an antitone sequence of sets.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.to_has_basis'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.is_basis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.exists_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.coprod.is_countably_generated", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_principal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.mem_iff_inf_principal_compl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.disjoint_principal_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.sInter_sets", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.filter_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.prod.is_countably_generated", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_basis", "description": "`is_basis p s` means the image of `s` bounded by `p` is a filter basis.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_basis.nonempty", "description": "`is_basis p s` means the image of `s` bounded by `p` is a filter basis.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_basis.inter", "description": "`is_basis p s` means the image of `s` bounded by `p` is a filter basis.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_supr", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_antitone_basis.mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.ge_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.coprod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.prod_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.as_basis_filter", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.property_index", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.disjoint_principal_principal", "d