as_basis.forall_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_antitone_basis", "description": " We say that a filter `l` has an antitone basis `s : \u03b9 \u2192 set \u03b1`, if `t \u2208 l` if and only if `t`\nincludes `s i` for some `i`, and `s` is decreasing.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_antitone_basis.to_has_basis", "description": " We say that a filter `l` has an antitone basis `s : \u03b9 \u2192 set \u03b1`, if `t \u2208 l` if and only if `t`\nincludes `s i` for some `i`, and `s` is decreasing.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_antitone_basis.antitone", "description": " We say that a filter `l` has an antitone basis `s : \u03b9 \u2192 set \u03b1`, if `t \u2208 l` if and only if `t`\nincludes `s i` for some `i`, and `s` is decreasing.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_basis.has_basis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.countable_filter_basis", "description": " A countable filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty countable collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.countable_filter_basis.to_filter_basis", "description": " A countable filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty countable collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.countable_filter_basis.countable", "description": " A countable filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty countable collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.inf_ne_bot_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.prod_same_index_anti", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis", "description": " A filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.sets", "description": " A filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.nonempty", "description": " A filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.inter_sets", "description": " A filter basis `B` on a type `\u03b1` is a nonempty collection of sets of `\u03b1`\nsuch that the intersection of two elements of this collection contains some element\nof the collection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.nat.inhabited_countable_filter_basis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.compl_diagonal_mem_prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_antitone_basis.mem_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.nonempty_sets", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.comp_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.is_countably_generated_pure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.sup.is_countably_generated", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.index", "description": "Index of a basis set such that `s i \u2286 t` as an element of `subtype p`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.has_basis_self_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.has_basis.inf'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter_basis.has_mem", "description": " If `B` is a filter basis on `\u03b1`, and `U` a subset of `\