3b2` be the same space\n`alexandroff \u2115` with the cofinite topology.  Then `\u03b1` is compact, `\u03b2` is T1, and the identity map\n`id : \u03b1 \u2192 \u03b2` is a continuous equivalence that is not a homeomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.infinite", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.dense_embedding_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.not_continuous_cofinite_topology_of_symm", "description": " If `X` is an infinite type with discrete topology (e.g., `\u2115`), then the identity map from\n`cofinite_topology (alexandroff X)` to `alexandroff X` is not continuous.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_infty_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_open_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.infty", "description": "The point at infinity", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.connected_space", "description": "If `X` is not a compact space, then `alexandroff X` is a connected space.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_compl_range_coe_infty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_closed_iff_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_open_map_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.inseparable_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.compact_space", "description": "For any topological space `X`, its one point compactification is a compact space.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_closed_iff_of_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_open_iff_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.continuous_at_infty'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_compl_infty_ne_bot", "description": "If `X` is a non-compact space, then `\u221e` is not an isolated point of `alexandroff X`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_compl_coe_ne_bot", "description": " If `x` is not an isolated point of `X`, then `x : alexandroff X` is not an isolated point\nof `alexandroff X`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.opens_of_compl", "description": "An open set in `alexandroff X` constructed from a closed compact set in `X`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.specializes_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_compl_infty_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.infty_ne_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.compl_range_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.infty_mem_opens_of_compl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_open_iff_of_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.dense_range_coe", "description": "If `X` is not a compact space, then the natural embedding `X \u2192 alexandroff X` has dense range.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.t1_space", "description": "The one point compactification of a `t1_space` space is a `t1_space`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_compl_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_closed_infty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.has_basis_nhds_infty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.inseparable_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.is_open_range_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.coe_eq_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.nhds_within_coe_image", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.infty_not_mem_image_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.ne_infty_iff_exists", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.range_coe_union_infty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "alexandroff.normal_space", "descri