lanced", "description": " The `balanced t` asserts that the tree `t` satisfies the balance invariants\n(at every level).", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.valid'.node4_l_lemma\u2081", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.bounded.of_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.all_node4_r", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.rotate_r", "description": " Concatenate two nodes, performing a right rotation `(x y) z -> (x (y z))`\nif balance is upset.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.all_rotate_r", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.valid'.node3_r", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.sized.size_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.all_balance_r", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordset.has_insert", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.dual_erase_max", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.split_min_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordset.nil", "description": "O(1). The empty set.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.balanced_sz_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.valid'.of_gt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.size_eq_real_size", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.balanced_sz", "description": " The `balanced_sz l r` asserts that a hypothetical tree with children of sizes `l` and `r` is\nbalanced: either `l \u2264 \u03b4 * r` and `r \u2264 \u03b4 * r`, or the tree is trivial with a singleton on one side\nand nothing on the other.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.valid'.node4_l_lemma\u2084", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.bounded.mem_gt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.bounded.trans_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.any_iff_exists", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordnode.valid'.merge_lemma", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": 