orhood of `a` within `(a, +\u221e)` if and only if it contains an interval `(a, u)`\nwith `a < u < u'`, provided `a` is not a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub.frequently_nhds_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_topology.to_order_closed_topology", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Ici_self_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Ici'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Ici_iff_exists_Ico_subset", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` within `[a, +\u221e)` if and only if it contains an interval `[a, u)`\nwith `a < u`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Ici", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.nhds_within_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Ici_iff_exists_Ico_subset'", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` within `[a, +\u221e)` if and only if it contains an interval `[a, u)`\nwith `a < u < u'`, provided `a` is not a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_Ioo_at_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ioi_mem_nhds'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.is_lub_of_tendsto", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "comap_coe_nhds_within_Iio_of_Ioo_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Iic_eq'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.order_dual", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "eventually_le_of_tendsto_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Iic_iff_exists_mem_Ico_Ioc_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ioc_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_Iio_at_top", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "interior_Ici", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "closure_Ico", "description": "The closure of the interval `[a, b)` is the closed interval `[a, b]`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_on_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Ici_eq''", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub.frequently_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "interior_Ico", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cInf_mem_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Ioi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "gt_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Icc_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.frequently_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "right_nhds_within_Ico_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_of_tendsto_of_tendsto", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone.map_cinfi_of_continuous_at", "description": " A continuous monotone function sends indexed infimum to indexed infimum in conditionally\ncomplete linear order, under a boundedness assumption.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_ordered_add_comm_group.tendsto_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ge_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.exists_countable_dense_subset_no_bot_top", "description": " Let `s` be a dense set in a nontrivial dense linear order `\u03b1`. If `s` is a\nseparable space (e.g., if `\u03b1` has a second countable topology), then there exists a countable\ndense subset `t \u2286 s` such that `t` does not contain bottom/top elements of `\u03b1`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "antitone.map_cinfi_of_continuous_at", "description": " A continuous antitone function sends indexed infimum to indexed supremum in conditionally\ncomplete linear order, under a boundedness assumption.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_order", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub.nhds_within_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto_nhds_max_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_nhds_bot_mono'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.exists_seq_strict_anti_tendsto_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Ioc_mem_nhds_within_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Ioc_mem_nhds_within_Iio", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_at.eventually_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "induced_order_topology'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed_Icc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Ioi_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ico_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tfae_mem_nhds_within_Iic", "description": " The following statements are equivalent:\n\n0. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `(-\u221e, b]`\n1. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `[a, b]`\n2. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `(a, b]`\n3. `s` includes `(l, b]` for some `l \u2208 [a, b)`\n4. `s` includes `(l, b]` for some `l < b`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Ico", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub_of_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "interior_Iic'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_Ico_class_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "interior_Ioc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "exists_seq_strict_mono_tendsto_nhds_within", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "closure_Ioc", "description": "The closure of the interval `(a, b]` is the closed interval `[a, b]`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_basis_abs_sub_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "exists_Ioc_subset_of_mem_nhds'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto.at_bot_add", "description": " In a linearly ordered additive commutative group with the order topology, if `f` tends to\n`at_bot` and `g` tends to `C` then `f + g` tends to `at_bot`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_comp_coe_Ioo_at_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ioo_mem_nhds'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Iio_iff_exists_mem_Ico_Ioo_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.mem_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "closure_Ici", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tfae_mem_nhds_within_Iio", "description": " The following statements are equivalent:\n\n0. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `(-\u221e, b)`\n1. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `[a, b)`\n2. `s` is a neighborhood of `b` within `(a, b)`\n3. `s` includes `(l, b)` for some `l \u2208 [a, b)`\n4. `s` includes `(l, b)` for some `l < b`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_open_lt'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "frontier_Icc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_le_of_eventually_le", "description": "**Alias** of `le_of_tendsto_of_tendsto`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "interior_Ici'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.eventually.exists_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tfae_mem_nhds_within_Ici", "description": " The following statements are equivalent:\n\n0. `s` is a neighborhood of `a` within `[a, +\u221e)`\n1. `s` is a neighborhood of `a` within `[a, b]`\n2. `s` is a neighborhood of `a` within `[a, b)`\n3. `s` includes `[a, u)` for some `u \u2208 (a, b]`\n4. `s` includes `[a, u)` for some `u > a`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Iio_iff_exists_Ico_subset", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` within `(-\u221e, a)` if and only if it contains an interval `[l, a)`\nwith `l < a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_basis_Ioo_pos_of_pos", "description": "If `a` is positive we can form a basis from only nonnegative `Ioo` intervals", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone.tendsto_nhds_within_Ioi", "description": "A monotone map has a limit to the right of any point `x`, equal to `Inf (f '' (Ioi x))`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Ioc_eq_nhds_within_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Ici_basis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Iio_iff_exists_Ioo_subset", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` within `(-\u221e, a)` if and only if it contains an interval `(l, a)`\nwith `l < a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_of_tendsto_of_tendsto'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_within_at_Ico_iff_Iio", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_of_tendsto", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "map_coe_at_bot_of_Ioo_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "comap_coe_nhds_within_Ioi_of_Ioo_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_iff_exists_Ioo_subset'", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` if and only if it contains an interval `(l, u)` containing `a`,\nprovided `a` is neither a bottom element nor a top element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed_le'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "filter.tendsto.max", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "preimage_neg", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed.is_glb_mem", "description": "**Alias** of `is_glb.mem_of_is_closed`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_eq_order", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "antitone.map_cInf_of_continuous_at", "description": " If an antitone function is continuous at the infimum of a nonempty bounded below set `s`,\nthen it sends this infimum to the supremum of the image of `s`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Icc_mem_nhds_within_Ioi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_within_at_Ioc_iff_Ioi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.exists_between", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.exists_ge", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed.epigraph", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.topological_space.first_countable_topology", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_closed_topology.to_t2_space", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_open_iff_generate_intervals", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Icc_mem_nhds_within_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_if_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Ici_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "antitone.map_infi_of_continuous_at'", "description": " An antitone function continuous at the indexed infimum over a nonempty `Sort` sends this indexed\ninfimum to the indexed supremum of the composition.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ioc_mem_nhds'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi_Ici_mem_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.exists_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub.exists_seq_strict_mono_tendsto_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.mem_lower_bounds_of_tendsto", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "closure_le_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed.cInf_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "closure_Iio", "description": "The closure of the interval `(-\u221e, a)` is the interval `(-\u221e, a]`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "prod.order_closed_topology", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "dense.exists_gt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_closed_topology", "description": " A topology on a set which is both a topological space and a preorder is _order-closed_ if the\nset of points `(x, y)` with `x \u2264 y` is closed in the product space. We introduce this as a mixin.\nThis property is satisfied for the order topology on a linear order, but it can be satisfied more\ngenerally, and suffices to derive many interesting properties relating order and topology.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_closed_topology.is_closed_le'", "description": " A topology on a set which is both a topological space and a preorder is _order-closed_ if the\nset of points `(x, y)` with `x \u2264 y` is closed in the product space. We introduce this as a mixin.\nThis property is satisfied for the order topology on a linear order, but it can be satisfied more\ngenerally, and suffices to derive many interesting properties relating order and topology.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within.filter.ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.order_closed_topology", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_open_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_within_at_Icc_iff_Ici", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed.is_lub_mem", "description": "**Alias** of `is_lub.mem_of_is_closed`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "eventually_abs_sub_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "nhds_within_Iio_ne_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_nhds_top_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "map_coe_Ioo_at_top", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed_Ici", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_iff_exists_Ioo_subset", "description": "A set is a neighborhood of `a` if and only if it contains an interval `(l, u)` containing `a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_Icc_class_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "exists_seq_tendsto_Sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Ici_iff_exists_mem_Ioc_Ico_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_nhds_within_Iio_iff_exists_Ioo_subset'", "description": " A set is a neighborhood of `a` within `(-\u221e, a)` if and only if it contains an interval `(l, a)`\nwith `l < a`, provided `a` is not a bottom element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tendsto_of_tendsto_of_tendsto_of_le_of_le", "description": " **Squeeze theorem** (also known as **sandwich theorem**). This version assumes that inequalities\nhold everywhere.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "not_tendsto_at_top_of_tendsto_nhds", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_closed_le_prod", "description