lib"}, {"name": "CompHaus.to_Profinite_obj", "description": "(Implementation) The object part of the connected_components functor from compact Hausdorff spaces\nto Profinite spaces, given by quotienting a space by its connected components.\nSee: https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0900", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.has_coe_to_sort", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.forget_reflects_isomorphisms", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "CompHaus.to_Profinite", "description": "The connected_components functor from compact Hausdorff spaces to profinite spaces,\nleft adjoint to the inclusion functor.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.homeo_of_iso_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite_to_CompHaus", "description": "The fully faithful embedding of `Profinite` in `CompHaus`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.has_colimits", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.is_closed_map", "description": "Any morphism of profinite spaces is a closed map.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.iso_of_homeo_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite", "description": "The type of profinite topological spaces.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.to_CompHaus", "description": "The type of profinite topological spaces.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.is_totally_disconnected", "description": "The type of profinite topological spaces.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Fintype.to_Profinite", "description": " The natural functor from `Fintype` to `Profinite`, endowing a finite type with the\ndiscrete topology.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.to_CompHaus.reflective", "description": "The category of profinite sets is reflective in the category of compact hausdroff spaces", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Profinite.to_Top", "description": " The fully faithful embedding of `Profinite` in `Top`. This is definitionally th