add_monoid_hom.eq_lift_of_right_inverse` for the uniqueness lemma.\n\n```lean\n   G\u2081.\n   |  \\\n f |   \\ g\n   |    \\\n   v     \\\u231f\n   G\u2082----> G\u2083\n      \u2203!\u03c6\n```", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "subgroup.mem_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monoid_hom.of_left_inverse_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monoid_hom.range_eq_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monoid_hom.of_left_inverse", "description": "Computable alternative to `monoid_hom.of_injective`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_mem_cancel_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_subgroup.comap", "description": "The preimage of an `add_subgroup` along an `add_monoid` homomorphism\nis an `add_subgroup`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_monoid_hom.mem_ker", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_subgroup.mem_comap", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_subgroup.neg_mem_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "subgroup.map_eq_bot_iff_of_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_subgroup.closure_closure_coe_preimage", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monoid_hom.eq_lift_of_right_inverse", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_subgroup_class.coe_inclusion", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monoid_hom.lift_of_right_inverse", "description": " `lift_of_right_inverse f hf g hg` is the unique group homomorphism `\u03c6`\n\n* such that `\u03c6.comp f = g` (`monoid_hom.lift_of_right_inverse_comp`),\n* where `f : G\u2081 \u2192+* G\u2082` has a right_inverse `f_inv` (`hf`),\n* and `g : G\u2082 \u2192+* G\u2083` satisfies `hg : f.ker \u2264 g.ker`.\n\nSee `monoid_hom.eq_lift_of_right_inverse` for the uniqueness lemma.\n\n```lean\n   G\u2081.\n   |  \\\n f |   \\ g\n   |    \\\n   v     \\\u231f\n   G\u2082----> G\u2083\n      \u2203!\u03c6\n```", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_monoid_hom.ker_restrict", "description": "", "p": "mat