ription": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.densely_ordered", "description": "In a dense order `\u03b1`, the subtype from an `ord_connected` set is also densely ordered.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_Ioi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_Iic", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_Iio", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_empty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_antichain.ord_connected", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected.out", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected", "description": "We say that a set `s : set \u03b1` is `ord_connected` if for all `x y \u2208 s` it includes the\ninterval `[x, y]`. If `\u03b1` is a `densely_ordered` `conditionally_complete_linear_order` with\nthe `order_topology`, then this condition is equivalent to `is_preconnected s`. If `\u03b1` is a\n`linear_ordered_field`, then this condition is also equivalent to `convex \u03b1 s`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected.out'", "description": "We say that a set `s : set \u03b1` is `ord_connected` if for all `x y \u2208 s` it includes the\ninterval `[x, y]`. If `\u03b1` is a `densely_ordered` `conditionally_complete_linear_order` with\nthe `order_topology`, then this condition is equivalent to `is_preconnected s`. If `\u03b1` is a\n`linear_ordered_field`, then this condition is also equivalent to `convex \u03b1 s`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_preimage", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_of_Ioo", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected.preimage_anti", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.dual_ord_connected", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected_singleton", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected.uIcc_subset", "desc