 forgetting the first point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_class", "description": " `linear_isometry_class F R E E\u2082` asserts `F` is a type of bundled `R`-linear isometries\n`M \u2192 M\u2082`.\n\nThis is an abbreviation for `semilinear_isometry_class F (ring_hom.id R) E E\u2082`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.to_linear_equiv_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.complete_space_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.symm_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.of_surjective", "description": "Construct a linear isometry equiv from a surjective linear isometry.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.has_coe_to_fun", "description": " Helper instance for when there's too many metavariables to apply `fun_like.has_coe_to_fun`\ndirectly.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.apply_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry.coe_to_linear_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry.one_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.refl_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.self_comp_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.symm_trans_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.to_homeomorph_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry.nnnorm_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv_class", "description": " `linear_isometry_equiv_class F R E E\u2082` asserts `F` is a type of bundled `R`-linear isometries\n`M \u2192 M\u2082`.\n\nThis is an abbreviation for `semilinear_isometry_equiv_class F (ring_hom.id R) E E\u2082`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semilinear_isometry_class.to_semilinear_map_class", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_isometry_equiv.gr