hat `dsimp` can use. `simp` will never use this.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.sub_right_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.mul_left_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.sub_left_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coe_to_units", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "units.mul_left_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.add_right", "description": "Right addition of an additive unit is a permutation of the underlying type.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "units.mul_left_bijective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.sub_right", "description": "A version of `equiv.add_right (-a) b` that is defeq to `b - a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coe_to_add_units", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "units.mul_right_bijective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.add_right_bijective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.div_right", "description": "A version of `equiv.mul_right a\u207b\u00b9 b` that is defeq to `b / a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.add_left_bijective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.add_right", "description": "Right addition in an `add_group` is a permutation of the underlying type.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.div_left", "description": "A version of `equiv.mul_left a b\u207b\u00b9` that is defeq to `a / b`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.div_right_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.add_left", "description": "Left addition of an additive unit is a permutation of the underlying type.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_equiv.inv_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.div_right_eq_mul_right_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.add_left_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "units.coe_map_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.add_right_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.mul_left", "description": "Left multiplication in a `group` is a permutation of the underlying type.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.sub_left_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_inf", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.fun_unique_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod_iso", "description": " Order isomorphism between the space of monotone maps to `\u03b2 \u00d7 \u03b3` and the product of the spaces\nof monotone maps to `\u03b2` and `\u03b3`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.has_coe_to_fun", "description": " Helper instance for when there's too many metavariables to apply `fun_like.has_coe_to_fun`\ndirectly.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.with_top_map", "description": "Lift an order homomorphism `f : \u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` to an order homomorphism `with_top \u03b1 \u2192o with_top \u03b2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod\u2098_coe_coe_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_fun_eq_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_top.to_dual_bot_equiv_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.monotone", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.fst", "description": "`prod.fst` as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.pi_iso_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.snd", "description": "`prod.snd` as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.snd_comp_prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.ext", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.const_coe_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.lt_iff_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual", "description": "Reinterpret a bundled monotone function as a monotone function between dual orders.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.subtype.val_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_bot_congr_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.fun_unique", "description": "Order isomorphism between `\u03b1 \u2192 \u03b2` and `\u03b2`, where `\u03b1` has a unique element.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.to_order_hom", "description": "Convert an `order_embedding` to a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual_iso", "description": "`order_hom.dual` as an order isomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.id_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_bot.to_dual_top_equiv_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom_class.monotone", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "map_lt_map_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "codisjoint.map_order_iso", "description": "Note that this goal could also be stated `(codisjoint on f) a b`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.id", "description": "The identity function as bundled monotone function.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "codisjoint_map_order_iso_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.const", "description": "Constant function bundled as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.fst_prod_snd", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.coe_fn_hom_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.subtype.val", "description": "`subtype.val` as a bundled monotone function.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso", "description": " An order isomorphism is an equivalence such that `a \u2264 b \u2194 (f a) \u2264 (f b)`.\nThis definition is an abbreviation of `rel_iso (\u2264) (\u2264)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.fst_comp_prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_order_embedding", "description": "Reinterpret an order isomorphism as an order embedding.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_top.coe_to_dual_bot_equiv_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rel_embedding.order_embedding_of_lt_embedding_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.copy_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.unique", "description": "There is a unique monotone map from a subsingleton to itself.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.apply_eq_iff_eq_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.dual", "description": "An order isomorphism is also an order isomorphism between dual orders.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.ext", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.well_founded", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_apply_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_top.to_dual_bot_equiv_symm_top", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_top'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.with_top_map_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.is_compl_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.symm_dual_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual_apply_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_top.to_dual_bot_equiv_symm_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.trans_refl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod\u2098", "description": " Given two bundled monotone maps `f`, `g`, `f.prod g` is the map `x \u21a6 (f x, g x)` bundled as a\n`order_hom`. This is a fully bundled version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.with_bot_map", "description": "A version of `with_bot.map` for order embeddings.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.order_hom_eq_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.lt_embedding_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.trans", "description": "Composition of two order isomorphisms is an order isomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "disjoint.map_order_iso", "description": "Note that this goal could also be stated `(disjoint on f) a b`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod", "description": " Given two bundled monotone maps `f`, `g`, `f.prod g` is the map `x \u21a6 (f x, g x)` bundled as a\n`order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.curry_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.with_top_map_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_top_congr_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "disjoint_map_order_iso_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.pi", "description": " Construct a bundled monotone map `\u03b1 \u2192o \u03a0 i, \u03c0 i` from a family of monotone maps\n`f i : \u03b1 \u2192o \u03c0 i`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.apply", "description": " Function application `\u03bb f, f a` (for fixed `a`) is a monotone function from the\nmonotone function space `\u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` to `\u03b2`. See also `pi.eval_order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_bot_congr_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom_class", "description": "`order_hom_class F \u03b1 b` asserts that `F` is a type of `\u2264`-preserving morphisms.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.map_inf_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.coe_of_strict_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.refl", "description": "Identity order isomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp", "description": "The composition of two bundled monotone functions.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_apply_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.bijective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_bot.to_dual_top_equiv_symm_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.on_diag_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.complemented_lattice_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.refl_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.complemented_lattice", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.acc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_bot.to_dual_top_equiv_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rel_embedding.order_embedding_of_lt_embedding", "description": "Embeddings of partial orders that preserve `<` also preserve `\u2264`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.partial_order", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp\u2098", "description": "The composition of two bundled monotone functions, a fully bundled version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.apply_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.coe_of_map_le_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.of_strict_mono", "description": "A strictly monotone map from a linear order is an order embedding.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.diag_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.dual", "description": "An order embedding is also an order embedding between dual orders.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_bot'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.has_coe_t", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.with_top_map", "description": "A version of `with_top.map` for order embeddings.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm", "description": "Inverse of an order isomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.of_rel_iso_lt_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.strict_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.const_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "strict_mono.order_iso_of_right_inverse", "description": "A strictly monotone function with a right inverse is an order isomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.subtype_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.of_map_le_iff", "description": "To define an order embedding from a partial order to a preorder it suffices to give a function\ntogether with a proof that it satisfies `f a \u2264 f b \u2194 a \u2264 b`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "strict_mono.order_iso_of_right_inverse_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_bot_congr", "description": "A version of `equiv.option_congr` for `with_bot`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.pi_iso_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.pi_iso", "description": " Order isomorphism between bundled monotone maps `\u03b1 \u2192o \u03a0 i, \u03c0 i` and families of bundled monotone\nmaps `\u03a0 i, \u03b1 \u2192o \u03c0 i`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_rel_iso_lt_of_rel_iso_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.coe_to_order_embedding", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.to_order_hom_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.monotone", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_top.to_dual_bot_equiv", "description": " Taking the dual then adding `\u22a4` is the same as adding `\u22a5` then taking the dual.\nThis is the order iso form of `with_top.of_dual`, as proven by `coe_to_dual_bot_equiv_eq`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_bot_congr_refl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.surjective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod_map", "description": "`prod.map` of two `order_hom`s as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.on_diag", "description": "Restriction of `f : \u03b1 \u2192o \u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` to the diagonal.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.dual_dual_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.preorder", "description": "The preorder structure of `\u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` is pointwise inequality: `f \u2264 g \u2194 \u2200 a, f a \u2264 g a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.order_hom_class", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.dual_dual_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_top_congr_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_apply_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.of_hom_inv", "description": "To show that `f : \u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` and `g : \u03b2 \u2192o \u03b1` make up an order isomorphism it is enough to show\n   that `g` is the inverse of `f`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pi.eval_order_hom", "description": "Evaluation of an unbundled function at a point (`function.eval`) as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom", "description": "Bundled monotone (aka, increasing) function", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.to_fun", "description": "Bundled monotone (aka, increasing) function", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.monotone'", "description": "Bundled monotone (aka, increasing) function", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.fun_unique_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rel_hom.to_order_hom", "description": " A bundled expression of the fact that a map between partial orders that is strictly monotone\nis weakly monotone.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.coe_dual_dual", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.dual_dual", "description": "The order isomorphism between a type and its double dual.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "with_bot.to_dual_top_equiv_symm_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.symm_dual_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.le_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_rel_iso_lt", "description": "Converts an `order_iso` into a `rel_iso (<) (<)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp_prod_comp_same", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.coe_dual_dual_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual_symm_apply_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.coe_to_order_iso", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.prod_comm", "description": "`prod.swap` as an `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.with_bot_map_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.coe_copy", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_top", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.of_rel_iso_lt", "description": "Converts a `rel_iso (<) (<)` into an `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_top_congr", "description": "A version of `equiv.option_congr` for `with_top`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.coe_fun_mk", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.with_bot_map", "description": "Lift an order homomorphism `f : \u03b1 \u2192o \u03b2` to an order homomorphism `with_bot \u03b1 \u2192o with_bot \u03b2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.with_bot_congr_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.refl_to_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.mk_le_mk", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.le_map_sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.refl_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.comp_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.to_order_iso_to_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod_iso_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.curry_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_trans_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.coe_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.lt_embedding", "description": "`<` is preserved by order embeddings of preorders.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.lt_iff_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "le_map_inv_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.prod_comm_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom_class.order_hom.has_coe_t", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.coe_refl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding", "description": " An order embedding is an embedding `f : \u03b1 \u21aa \u03b2` such that `a \u2264 b \u2194 (f a) \u2264 (f b)`.\nThis definition is an abbreviation of `rel_embedding (\u2264) (\u2264)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "map_inv_le_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.diag", "description": "Diagonal embedding of `\u03b1` into `\u03b1 \u00d7 \u03b1` as a `order_hom`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "strict_mono.order_iso_of_right_inverse_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_equiv_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.map_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.id_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.fst_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.of_cmp_eq_cmp", "description": "To show that `f : \u03b1 \u2192 \u03b2`, `g : \u03b2 \u2192 \u03b1` make up an order isomorphism of linear orders,\n   it suffices to prove `cmp a (g b) = cmp (f a) b`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.to_rel_iso_lt_apply", "description": "", "p": 