03b1 \u03b2` states that `F` is a type of order isomorphisms.\n\nYou should extend this class when you extend `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso_class.left_inv", "description": " `order_iso_class F \u03b1 \u03b2` states that `F` is a type of order isomorphisms.\n\nYou should extend this class when you extend `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso_class.right_inv", "description": " `order_iso_class F \u03b1 \u03b2` states that `F` is a type of order isomorphisms.\n\nYou should extend this class when you extend `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso_class.coe_injective'", "description": " `order_iso_class F \u03b1 \u03b2` states that `F` is a type of order isomorphisms.\n\nYou should extend this class when you extend `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso_class.map_le_map_iff", "description": " `order_iso_class F \u03b1 \u03b2` states that `F` is a type of order isomorphisms.\n\nYou should extend this class when you extend `order_iso`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.prod_iso_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.symm_refl", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.with_bot_map_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.coe_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.copy", "description": " Copy of an `order_hom` with a new `to_fun` equal to the old one. Useful to fix definitional\nequalities.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.dual_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.le_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_hom.pi_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.is_well_order", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso_class.to_order_hom_class", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_iso.of_rel_iso_lt_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_embedding.subtype", "description": "Embedding of a subtype into 