 "description": " A set `s` is not bounded above if and only if for each `x` there exists `y \u2208 s` that is greater\nthan `x`. A version for preorders is called `not_bdd_above_iff'`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone_on.map_is_greatest", "description": "A monotone map sends a greatest element of a set to a greatest element of its image.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_above_singleton", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_below.dual", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub.union", "description": " If `a` is the least upper bound of `s` and `b` is the least upper bound of `t`,\nthen `a \u2294 b` is the least upper bound of `s \u222a t`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.of_image", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_lub", "description": "`a` is a least upper bound of a set `s`; for a partial order, it is unique if exists.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone_on.mem_lower_bounds_image", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lower_bounds_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_below_Ioc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_greatest_singleton", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mem_lower_bounds_image2", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone.map_bdd_above", "description": " The image under a monotone function of a set which is bounded above is bounded above. See also\n`bdd_above.image2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_below_singleton", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb_singleton", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb.nonempty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_glb_pi", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lt_is_glb_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "upper_bounds_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "monotone.map_is_greatest", "description": "A monotone map sends a greatest element of a set to a greatest element of its image.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "upper_bo