"description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.by_contradiction", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.ematch", "description": "Produce new facts using heuristic lemma instantiation based on E-matching.\nThis tactic tries to match patterns from lemmas in the main goal with terms\nin the main goal. The set of lemmas is populated with theorems\ntagged with the attribute specified at smt_config.em_attr, and lemmas\nadded using tactics such as `smt_tactic.add_lemmas`.\nThe current set of lemmas can be retrieved using the tactic `smt_tactic.get_lemmas`.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.destruct", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.execute_with", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.induction", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.guard_target", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.intros", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.have", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_eqn_lemmas", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.itactic", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.trace", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_eqn_lemmas_for", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.dsimp", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.trace_state", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.eblast", "description": "Keep applying heuristic instantiation until the current goal is solved, or it fails.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_simp_lemmas", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.let", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.try", "description": "Try the given tactic, and do nothing if it fails.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.iterate", "description": "Keep applying the given tactic until it fails.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_lemma", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.save_info", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.execute", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.istep", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.apply", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.close", "description": "Try to close main goal by using equalities implied by the congruence\nclosure module.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.eblast_using", "description": "Keep applying heuristic instantiation using the given lemmas until the current goal is solved, or it fails.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.step", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.by_contra", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.from", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.rsimp", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.simp", "description": "Simplify the target type of the main goal.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.apply_instance", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.change", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.ematch_using", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_fact", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.skip", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.by_cases", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.all_goals", "description": "Apply the given tactic to all remaining goals.", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.add_lhs_lemma", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.guard_expr_eq", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "smt_tactic.interactive.executor", "description": "",