e\nlinear part.\n\nSee note [bundled maps over different rings]", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.comp_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.homothety", "description": "`homothety c r` is the homothety (also known as dilation) about `c` with scale factor `r`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.vsub_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.coe_mk", "description": " Constructing an affine map and coercing back to a function\nproduces the same map.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.linear_injective_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.line_map_same_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.line_map_eq_left_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.line_map_apply_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.line_map_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "convex.combo_affine_apply", "description": " Applying an affine map to an affine combination of two points yields an affine combination of\nthe images.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.fst_linear", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.line_map_apply_ring'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.coe_smul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.map_vadd", "description": " An affine map on the result of adding a vector to a point produces\nthe same result as the linear map applied to that vector, added to the\naffine map applied to that point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.coe_homothety_affine", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.linear_eq_zero_iff_exists_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_map.decomp", "description": " Decomposition of an affine map in the special case when the point space and vector space\nare the same.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.to_affine_map_linear", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "affine_m