uch that `a * b = c * b` implies `a = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "right_cancel_semigroup.mul_assoc", "description": "A `right_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = c * b` implies `a = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "right_cancel_semigroup.mul_right_cancel", "description": "A `right_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = c * b` implies `a = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "coe_nat_zsmul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class.to_is_right_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "left_inv_eq_right_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_right_cancel_semigroup.to_is_right_cancel_add", "description": "Any `add_right_cancel_semigroup` satisfies `is_right_cancel_add`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_left_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_left_cancel_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.mul", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.mul_assoc", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.mul_left_cancel", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.one", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.one_mul", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.mul_one", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.npow", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.npow_zero'", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.npow_succ'", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "cancel_monoid.mul_right_cancel", "description": "A monoid in which multiplication is cancellative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sub_eq_add_neg", "description": "Subtracting an element is the same as adding by its negative.\n\nThis is a duplicate of `sub_neg_monoid.sub_eq_mul_neg` ensuring that the types unfold better.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "left_cancel_semigroup", "description": "A `left_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = a * c` implies `b = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "left_cancel_semigroup.mul", "description": "A `left_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = a * c` implies `b = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "left_cancel_semigroup.mul_assoc", "description": "A `left_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = a * c` implies `b = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "left_cancel_semigroup.mul_left_cancel", "description": "A `left_cancel_semigroup` is a semigroup such that `a * b = a * c` implies `b = c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "sub_neg_monoid.has_smul_int", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "comm_semigroup.ext_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "subtraction_monoid.to_sub_neg_monoid", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semigroup", "description": "A semigroup is a type with an associative `(*)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semigroup.mul", "description": "A semigroup is a type with an associative `(*)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semigroup.mul_assoc", "description": "A semigroup is a type with an associative `(*)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "right_cancel_semigroup.ext_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_smul", "description": "Typeclass for types with a scalar multiplication operation, denoted `\u2022` (`\\bu`)", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_smul.smul", "description": "Typeclass for types with a scalar multiplication operation, denoted `\u2022` (`\\bu`)", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_cancel_mul.to_is_right_cancel_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_right_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class", "description": " Typeclass for expressing that a type `M` with addition and a zero satisfies\n`0 + a = a` and `a + 0 = a` for all `a : M`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class.zero", "description": " Typeclass for expressing that a type `M` with addition and a zero satisfies\n`0 + a = a` and `a + 0 = a` for all `a : M`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class.add", "description": " Typeclass for expressing that a type `M` with addition and a zero satisfies\n`0 + a = a` and `a + 0 = a` for all `a : M`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class.zero_add", "description": " Typeclass for expressing that a type `M` with addition and a zero satisfies\n`0 + a = a` and `a + 0 = a` for all `a : M`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_zero_class.add_zero", "description": " Typeclass for expressing that a type `M` with addition and a zero satisfies\n`0 + a = a` and `a + 0 = a` for all `a : M`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pow_succ", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "div_inv_one_monoid.to_inv_one_class", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_one_class.to_has_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_inv_cancel_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "division_comm_monoid.to_division_monoid", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_right_cancel_monoid.to_add_right_cancel_semigroup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "comm_group.to_group_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_left_inj", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_comm_semigroup.is_left_cancel_add.to_is_right_cancel_add", "description": "Any\n`add_comm_semigroup G` that satisfies `is_left_cancel_add G` also satisfies\n`is_left_cancel_add G`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_comm_monoid.to_add_comm_semigroup", "descript