Auxiliary definition for `diagram`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.cocone", "description": "Given a function `U : \u03b9 \u2192 \u03b1` for `[complete_lattice \u03b1]`,\n`supr U` provides a cocone over `diagram U`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.cocone_\u03b9_app_2", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.category_theory.category", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.pairwise_inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.cocone_is_colimit", "description": "Given a function `U : \u03b9 \u2192 \u03b1` for `[complete_lattice \u03b1]`,\n`infi U` provides a limit cone over `diagram U`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.diagram_obj", "description": "Auxiliary definition for `diagram`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.hom", "description": "Morphisms in the category `pairwise \u03b9`. The only non-identity morphisms are\n`left i j : single i \u27f6 pair i j` and `right i j : single j \u27f6 pair i j`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.hom.id_single", "description": "Morphisms in the category `pairwise \u03b9`. The only non-identity morphisms are\n`left i j : single i \u27f6 pair i j` and `right i j : single j \u27f6 pair i j`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.hom.id_pair", "description": "Morphisms in the category `pairwise \u03b9`. The only non-identity morphisms are\n`left i j : single i \u27f6 pair i j` and `right i j : single j \u27f6 pair i j`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.hom.left", "description": "Morphisms in the category `pairwise \u03b9`. The only non-identity morphisms are\n`left i j : single i \u27f6 pair i j` and `right i j : single j \u27f6 pair i j`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.pairwise.hom.right", "description": "Morphisms in the category `pairwise \u03b9`. The only non-identity morphisms 