n.pullback_cone_of_left_fst", "description": "(Implementation.) The projection map when constructing the pullback along an open immersion.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.sigma_\u03b9_open_embedding", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.of_is_iso", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_SheafedSpace_hom", "description": "If `X \u27f6 Y` is an open immersion of PresheafedSpaces, and `Y` is a SheafedSpace, we can\nupgrade it into a morphism of SheafedSpaces.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_cone_of_left_condition", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.inv_app_app_assoc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.SheafedSpace_has_pullback_of_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_iso", "description": "An open immersion is an iso if the underlying continuous map is epi.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.SheafedSpace_has_pullback_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.category_theory.mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.forget_reflects_pullback_of_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_cone_of_left_is_limit", "description": "The constructed `pullback_cone_of_left` is indeed limiting.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_cone_of_left_lift", "description": "(Implementation.) Any cone over `cospan f g` indeed factors through the constructed cone.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift_fac_assoc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift", "description": "The universal property of open immersions:\nFor an open immersion `f : X \u27f6 Z`, given any morphism of schemes `g : Y \u27f6 Z` whose topological\nimage is contained in the image of `f`, we can lift this morphism to a unique `Y \u27f6 X` that\ncommutes with these maps.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_cone_of_left", "description": "We construct the pullback along an open immersion via restricting along the pullback of the\nmaps of underlying spaces (which is also an open embedding).", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift", "description": "The universal property of open immersions:\nFor an open immersion `f : X \u27f6 Z`, given any morphism of schemes `g : Y \u27f6 Z` whose topological\nimage is contained in the image of `f`, we can lift this morphism to a unique `Y \u27f6 X` that\ncommutes with these maps.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.app_inv_app'", "description": "A variant of `app_inv_app` that gives an `eq_to_hom` instead of `hom_of_le`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.forget_preserves_limits_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion", "description": "A morphism of SheafedSpaces is an open immersion if it is an open immersion as a morphism\nof PresheafedSpaces", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.iso_restrict", "description": "An open immersion `f : X \u27f6 Y` induces an isomorphism `X \u2245 Y|_{f(X)}`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.app_inv_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.inv_app_app_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.has_pullback_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.forget_to_PresheafedSpace_preserves_pullback_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift_range", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.SheafedSpace_pullback_to_base_is_open_immersion", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.comp", "description": "The composition of two open immersions is an open immersion.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_fst_of_right", "description": "Open immersions are stable under base-change.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_to_base_is_open_immersion", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.pullback_cone_of_left_lift_snd", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.SheafedSpace_forget_preserves_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.of_stalk_iso", "description": "Suppose `X Y : SheafedSpace C`, where `C` is a concrete category,\nwhose forgetful functor reflects isomorphisms, preserves limits and filtered colimits.\nThen a morphism `X \u27f6 Y` that is a topological open embedding\nis an open immersion iff every stalk map is an iso.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.forget_to_PresheafedSpace_reflects_pullback_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.has_pullback_of_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.has_limit_cospan_forget_of_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift_fac", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.lift_fac_assoc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.forget_preserves_pullback_of_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion", "description": "A morphism of LocallyRingedSpaces is an open immersion if it is an open immersion as a morphism\nof SheafedSpaces", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.LocallyRingedSpace.is_open_immersion.of_is_iso", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.iso_of_range_eq_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_LocallyRingedSpace_to_SheafedSpace", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_SheafedSpace_to_PresheafedSpace", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.inv_inv_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.inv_app_app", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.PresheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.to_SheafedSpace_hom_base", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.has_limit_cospan_forget_of_right'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebraic_geometry.SheafedSpace.is_open_immersion.SheafedSpace_pullback_fst_of_right", "description":