re not defined), so we require this as well in the definition.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.ident_distrib.comp_of_ae_measurable", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.mem_\u2112p.uniform_integrable_of_ident_distrib_aux", "description": " This lemma is superceded by `mem_\u2112p.uniform_integrable_of_ident_distrib` which only require\n`ae_strongly_measurable`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.ident_distrib.add_const", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.ident_distrib.coe_nnreal_ennreal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.ident_distrib.symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "probability_theory.ident_distrib.ae_mem_snd", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.forget_reflects_limits", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.normal_epi", "description": "In the category of modules, every epimorphism is normal.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.forget_reflects_limits_of_size", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.exact_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.forget\u2082_reflects_limits", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.forget\u2082_reflects_limits_of_size", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.abelian", "description": "The category of R-modules is abelian.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.normal_mono", "description": "In the category of modules, every monomorphism is normal.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.covariant_class_mul_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.covariant_class_swap_mul_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.linear_ordered_add_comm_monoid", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.covariant_class_swap_add_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order_dual.contravariant_class_swap_mul_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "order