n `equiv.perm.is_cycle` and `equiv.perm.is_cycle_on`\nin non-degenerate cases.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle_on", "description": " A permutation is a cycle on `s` when any two points of `s` are related by repeated application\nof the permutation. Note that this means the identity is a cycle of subsingleton sets.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.product_self_eq_disj_Union_perm_aux", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle.exists_pow_eq_one", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.same_cycle_zpow_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle_cycle_of_iff", "description": "`x` is in the support of `f` iff `equiv.perm.cycle_of f x` is a cycle.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.same_cycle.of_inv", "description": "**Alias** of the forward direction of `equiv.perm.same_cycle_inv`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.cycle_of_apply_apply_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.nodup_of_pairwise_disjoint_cycles", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.same_cycle.of_pow_left", "description": "**Alias** of the forward direction of `equiv.perm.same_cycle_pow_left`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.disjoint.cycle_of_mul_distrib", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle_on_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.cycle_factors_finset_eq_empty_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.same_cycle.cycle_of_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.same_cycle.of_apply_right", "description": "**Alias** of the forward direction of `equiv.perm.same_cycle_apply_right`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle_on.of_inv", "description": "**Alias** of the forward direction of `equiv.perm.is_cycle_on_inv`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "equiv.perm.is_cycle.eq_swap_of_apply_