 hoc class stating that the closure of an upper set is an upper set. This is used to state\nlemmas that do not mention algebraic operations for both the additive and multiplicative versions\nsimultaneously. If you find a satisfying replacement for this typeclass, please remove it!", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_upper_lower_closure.is_open_lower_closure", "description": " Ad hoc class stating that the closure of an upper set is an upper set. This is used to state\nlemmas that do not mention algebraic operations for both the additive and multiplicative versions\nsimultaneously. If you find a satisfying replacement for this typeclass, please remove it!", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_open.lower_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.ord_connected.interior", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_above.of_closure", "description": "**Alias** of the forward direction of `bdd_above_closure`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_below_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ordered_add_comm_group.to_has_upper_lower_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_above.closure", "description": "**Alias** of the reverse direction of `bdd_above_closure`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_open.upper_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_upper_set.interior", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "bdd_above_closure", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.direct_limit_is_colimit", "description": " The unbundled `direct_limit` of modules is a colimit\nin the sense of `category_theory`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.direct_limit_diagram_obj", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.module_obj", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.has_limits", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Module.has_limits.limit_cone_is_limit", "description": "Witness that the limit cone in `Module R` is a limit cone.\n(Internal use only; use the limits API.)", "p": "