s.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimit_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits of `K.op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves\n   colimits of `K : J \u2964 C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.perserves_colimits_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves limits, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimit_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits of `K.left_op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C`, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves\n   colimits of `K : J \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_of_shape_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves limits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits\n   of shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_limits_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves finite colimits, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite\n   limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves colimits, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_limits_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves finite colimits, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite\n   limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_colimits_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves finite limits, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite\n   colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_colimits_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves finite limits, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite\n   colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_of_shape_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves colimits\n   of shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimit_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves limits of `K.op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves\n   colimits of `K : J \u2964 C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_of_shape_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves limits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits of\n   shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves limits, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_of_shape_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves colimits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits\n   of shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves colimits, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_of_shape_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves colimits\n   of shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_of_shape_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves colimits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits of\n   shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_colimits_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite limits, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves finite\n   colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limit_right_op", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves colimits of `K.op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.right_op : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves\n   limits of `K : J \u2964 C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limit_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits of `K.op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves\n   limits of `K : J \u2964 C`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_colimits_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite limits, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves finite\n   colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_finite_limits_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves finite colimits, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves finite\n   limits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_of_shape_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D` preserves limits\n   of shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimits_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves limits, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves colimits.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limit_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves colimits of `K.left_op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C`, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves\n   limits of `K : J \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limit_left_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits of `K.left_op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C`, then `F.left_op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D`\n   preserves limits of `K : J \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_limits_of_shape_unop", "description": "If `F : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves colimits of shape `J\u1d52\u1d56`, then `F.unop : C \u2964 D` preserves limits of\n   shape `J`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.limits.preserves_colimit_op", "description": "If `F : C \u2964 D` preserves limits of `K.left_op : J\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 C`, then `F.op : C\u1d52\u1d56 \u2964 D\u1d52\u1d56` preserves\n   colimits of `K : J \u2964 C\u1d52\u1d56`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul'", "description": "The multiplication map on a non-unital algebra, as an `R`-linear map from `A \u2297[R] A` to `A`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right_zero_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left", "description": "The multiplication on the left in a non-unital algebra is a linear map.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_apply'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_eq_zero_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.pow_mul_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.commute_mul_left_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right", "description": "The multiplication on the right in an algebra is a linear map.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul'_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_one", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_to_add_monoid_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_right", "description": "Simultaneous multiplication on the left and right is a linear map.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "algebra.coe_lmul_eq_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.pow_mul_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right_to_add_monoid_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_zero_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_alg_hom.coe_lmul_eq_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_right_eq_zero_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul_left_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "linear_map.mul", "description": " The multiplication in a non-unital non-associative algebra is a bilinear map.\n\nA weaker version of this for semirings exists as `add_monoid_hom.mul`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_alg_hom.lmul", "description": " The multiplication in a non-unital algebra is a bilinear map.\n\nA weaker version of this for non-unita