lication in a ring is an additive monoid morphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_group_hom.neg", "description": "The negation of an additive group homomorphism is an additive group homomorphism\nif the target is commutative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_monoid_hom.map_mul", "description": "A monoid homomorphism preserves multiplication.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "additive.is_add_group_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_monoid_hom.neg", "description": "The negation of a map which preserves addition, preserves addition\nwhen the target is commutative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_monoid_hom.is_add_monoid_hom_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_hom.add", "description": "A sum of maps which preserves addition, preserves addition when the target\nis commutative.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_equiv.is_add_monoid_hom", "description": "An additive bijection between two additive monoids is an additive\nmonoid hom (deprecated).", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_group_hom.comp", "description": "The composition of two additive group homomorphisms is an additive\ngroup homomorphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_monoid_hom.of", "description": "Interpret a map `f : M \u2192 N` as a homomorphism `M \u2192+ N`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_mul_hom", "description": "Predicate for maps which preserve a multiplication.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_mul_hom.map_mul", "description": "Predicate for maps which preserve a multiplication.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "additive.is_add_monoid_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_monoid_hom.map_add", "description": "An additive monoid homomorphism preserves addition.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_group_hom.map_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "mul_equiv.is_group_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_add_monoid_hom.is_add_monoid_hom_mul_right", "description": "Right multiplication in a ring is an additive monoid m