`a` semiconjugates `x` to `a * x * a\u207b\u00b9`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semiconj_by.units_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semiconj_by_iff_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.neg_neg_symm", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semiconj_by.eq", "description": "Equality behind `semiconj_by a x y`; useful for rewriting.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.neg_right_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.conj_mk", "description": "`a` semiconjugates `x` to `a + x + -a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.add_right", "description": "If `a` semiconjugates `x` to `y` and `x'` to `y'`, then it semiconjugates\n`x + x'` to `y + y'`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.reflexive", "description": "The relation \u201cthere exists an element that semiconjugates `a` to `b`\u201d on an additive\nmonoid (or, more generally, on a `add_zero_class` type) is reflexive.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.neg_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_units.mk_semiconj_by", "description": "`a` semiconjugates `x` to `a + x + -a`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semiconj_by.inv_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.add_units_neg_right", "description": "If `a` semiconjugates an additive unit `x` to an additive unit `y`, then it\nsemiconjugates `-x` to `-y`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "semiconj_by.units_inv_right", "description": "If `a` semiconjugates a unit `x` to a unit `y`, then it semiconjugates `x\u207b\u00b9` to `y\u207b\u00b9`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.add_units_coe_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.eq", "description": "Equality behind `add_semiconj_by a x y`; useful for rewriting.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "units.mk_semiconj_by", "description": "`a` semiconjugates `x` to `a * x * a\u207b\u00b9`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "add_semiconj_by.add_units_neg_