-canonical terms", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.and", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes non-canonical terms", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.univ_close_of_valid", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.has_to_format", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.holds", "description": "Evaluate a preform into prop using the valuation `v`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.valid_of_unsat_not", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.induce", "description": "Tactic for setting up proof by induction over preforms.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.fresh_index", "description": "Fresh de Brujin index not used by any variable in argument", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.implies", "description": "`implies p q` := under any valuation, `q` holds if `p` holds", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.sat", "description": "There exists some valuation that satisfies argument", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform.eq", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform.le", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform.not", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform.or", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.exprform.and", "description": "Intermediate shadow syntax for LNA formulas that includes unreified exprs", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.valid", "description": "All valuations satisfy argument", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.holds_constant", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.sat_of_implies_of_sat", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.unsat", "description": "There does not exist any valuation that satisfies argument", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.sat_or", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.equiv", "description": "`equiv p q` := under any valuation, `p` holds iff `q` holds", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.has_reflect", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.univ_close", "description": "`univ_close p n` := `p` closed by prepending `n` universal quantifiers", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.nat.preform.neg_free", "description": "Argument is free of negations", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1_to_Gamma0_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_cong_eq_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1_in_Gamma0", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma0_det", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_one_top", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_is_cong_sub", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_congruence_subgroup", "description": "A congruence subgroup is a subgroup of `SL(2, \u2124)` which contains some `Gamma N` for some\n`(N : \u2115+)`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_mem'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma0_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma0_is_congruence", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_normal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1_is_congruence", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "SL_reduction_mod_hom_val", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma", "description": "The full level `N` congruence subgroup of `SL(2, \u2124)` of matrices that reduce to the identity\nmodulo `N`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "conj_cong_is_cong", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_0_map", "description": "The group homomorphism from `Gamma0` to `zmod N` given by mapping a matrix to its lower\nright-hand entry.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma_zero_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1", "description": "The congruence subgroup `Gamma1` of `SL(2, \u2124)` consisting of matrices whose bottom\nrow is congruent to `(0,1)` modulo `N`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma0", "description": "The congruence subgroup of `SL(2, \u2124)` of matrices whose lower left-hand entry reduces to zero\nmodulo `N`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1_mem'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_congruence_subgroup_trans", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "Gamma1'", "description": "The congruence subgroup `Gamma1` (as a subgroup of `Gamma0`) of matrices whose bottom\nrow is congruent to `(0,1)` modulo `N`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_map_mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.dvd_val", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_add", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_add_val_between", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_except", "description": "`val_except k v as` is the value (under valuation `v`) of the term\n   obtained taking the term represented by `(0, as)` and dropping the\n   subterm that includes the `k`th variable.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_sub", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.forall_val_dvd_of_forall_mem_dvd", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_set", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_map_div", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_add", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.dvd_val_between", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_nil", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_eq_of_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between", "description": "`val_between v as l o` is the value (under valuation `v`) of the term\n   obtained taking the term represented by `(0, as)` and dropping all\n   subterms that include variables outside the range `[l,l+o)`", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_sub", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_eq_of_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_eq_val_between", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_except_add_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_except_update_set", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_neg", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_neg", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_between_set", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_nil", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_except_eq_val_except", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val", "description": "Evaluation of the nonconstant component of a normalized linear arithmetic term.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "omega.coeffs.val_map_div", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.projective_plane.two_lt_point_count", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.dual.has_points", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.dual.has_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.projective_plane.card_points", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.line_count_le_point_count", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.card_le", "description": "If a nondegenerate configuration has a unique point on any two lines, then `|L| \u2264 |P|`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_lines.exists_bijective_of_card_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.nondegenerate", "description": "A configuration is nondegenerate if:\n 1) there does not exist a line that passes through all of the points,\n 2) there does not exist a point that is on all of the lines,\n 3) there is at most one line through any two points,\n 4) any two lines have at most one intersection point.\n Conditions 3 and 4 are equivalent.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.nondegenerate.exists_point", "description": "A configuration is nondegenerate if:\n 1) there does not exist a line that passes through all of the points,\n 2) there does not exist a point that is on all of the lines,\n 3) there is at most one line through any two points,\n 4) any two lines have at most one intersection point.\n Conditions 3 and 4 are equivalent.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.nondegenerate.exists_line", "description": "A configuration is nondegenerate if:\n 1) there does not exist a line that passes through all of the points,\n 2) there does not exist a point that is on all of the lines,\n 3) there is at most one line through any two points,\n 4) any two lines have at most one intersection point.\n Conditions 3 and 4 are equivalent.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.nondegenerate.eq_or_eq", "description": "A configuration is nondegenerate if:\n 1) there does not exist a line that passes through all of the points,\n 2) there does not exist a point that is on all of the lines,\n 3) there is at most one line through any two points,\n 4) any two lines have at most one intersection point.\n Conditions 3 and 4 are equivalent.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.to_nondegenerate", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.line_count_eq_point_count", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.dual.fintype", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.projective_plane.to_has_points", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.exists_point", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.exists_line", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.eq_or_eq", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.mk_point", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.mk_point_ax", "description": "A nondegenerate configuration in which every pair of lines has an intersection point.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.dual.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.projective_plane.to_has_lines", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.projective_plane.point_count_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_points.has_lines", "description": "If a nondegenerate configuration has a unique point on any two lines, and if `|P| = |L|`,\n then there is a unique line through any two points.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "configuration.has_lines.has_points", "description": "If a nondegenerate