l_non_assoc_ring", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ring_hom.prod_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_ring_hom.snd", "description": "Given non-unital semirings `R`, `S`, the natural projection homomorphism from `R \u00d7 S` to `S`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ring_hom.snd_comp_prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ring_equiv.prod_prod_prod_comm_to_add_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_ring_hom.snd_comp_prod", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "ring_equiv.prod_zero_ring_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "prod.ordered_ring", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "non_unital_ring_hom.prod_map_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "tactic.exfalso", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "tactic.contradiction", "description": "", "p": "core"}, {"name": "polynomial.monic.is_eisenstein_at_of_mem_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.exists_mem_adjoin_mul_eq_pow_nat_degree_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.pow_nat_degree_le_of_aeval_zero_of_monic_mem_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.irreducible", "description": " If a primitive `f` satisfies `f.is_eisenstein_at \ud835\udcdf`, where `\ud835\udcdf.is_prime`, then `f` is\nirreducible.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.is_weakly_eisenstein_at", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.scale_roots.is_weakly_eisenstein_at", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.pow_nat_degree_le_of_root_of_monic_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `f.leading_coeff \u2209 \ud835\udcdf`, `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf` and\n`f.coeff 0 \u2209 \ud835\udcdf ^ 2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.leading", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `f.leading_coeff \u2209 \ud835\udcdf`, `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf` and\n`f.coeff 0 \u2209 \ud835\udcdf ^ 2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.mem", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `f.leading_coeff \u2209 \ud835\udcdf`, `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf` and\n`f.coeff 0 \u2209 \ud835\udcdf ^ 2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.not_mem", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `f.leading_coeff \u2209 \ud835\udcdf`, `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf` and\n`f.coeff 0 \u2209 \ud835\udcdf ^ 2`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.dvd_pow_nat_degree_of_eval\u2082_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at.coeff_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_eisenstein_at_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.dvd_pow_nat_degree_of_aeval_eq_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.monic.leading_coeff_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *weakly Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.mem", "description": " Given an ideal `\ud835\udcdf` of a commutative semiring `R`, we say that a polynomial `f : R[X]`\nis *weakly Eisenstein at `\ud835\udcdf`* if `\u2200 n, n < f.nat_degree \u2192 f.coeff n \u2208 \ud835\udcdf`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "polynomial.is_weakly_eisenstein_at.exists_mem_adjoin_mul_eq_pow_nat_degree", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure_insert", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure", "description": "The smallest set of sets containing `S` which is closed under finite intersections.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure.basic", "description": "The smallest set of sets containing `S` which is closed under finite intersections.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure.univ", "description": "The smallest set of sets containing `S` which is closed under finite intersections.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure.inter", "description": "The smallest set of sets containing `S` which is closed under finite intersections.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.finite_inter_closure_has_finite_inter", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter", "description": "A structure encapsulating the fact that a set of sets is closed under finite intersection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.univ_mem", "description": "A structure encapsulating the fact that a set of sets is closed under finite intersection.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "has_finite_inter.inter_mem", "description": "A structure encapsulating the fact that a set of sets is closed under finite intersection.", "p