", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.shift_zero", "description": "Shifting by zero is the identity functor.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.shift_add", "description": "Shifting by `i + j` is the same as shifting by `i` and then shifting by `j`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.nat_trans.right_derived_eq", "description": "A component of the natural transformation between right-derived functors can be computed\nusing a chosen injective resolution.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.functor.right_derived", "description": "The right derived functors of an additive functor.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.functor.right_derived_obj_injective_succ", "description": "The higher derived functors vanish on injective objects.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.abelian.functor.right_derived_zero_to_self_app_comp_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.functor.right_derived_obj_injective_zero_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.functor.right_derived_obj_injective_zero_inv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.functor.right_derived_obj_iso_hom", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.abelian.functor.right_derived_zero_to_self_app_iso", "description": " Given `P : InjectiveResolution X`, the isomorphism `(F.right_derived 0).obj X \u2245 F.obj X` if\n`preserves_finite_limits F`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.nat_trans.right_derived_comp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.nat_trans.right_derived_id", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.abelian.functor.right_derived_zero_to_self_app", "description": " Given `P : InjectiveResolution X`, a morphism `(F.right_derived 0).obj X \u27f6 F.obj X` given\n`preserves_finite_limits F`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "category_theory.abelian.functor.right_derived_zero_iso_self", "description": "Given `preserv