relation `x \u2248 y \u2194 x \u2264 y \u2227 y \u2264 x`. In the quotient,\nthe order becomes a total order.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.relabelling.numeric_imp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.numeric_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.numeric.add", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.numeric_of_is_empty", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "surreal.linear_ordered_add_comm_group", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.numeric_of_is_empty_left_moves", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "surreal.has_lt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pgame.lt_or_equiv_or_gt", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "surreal.has_zero", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.orthogonal_gc", "description": " `orthogonal` gives a `galois_connection` between\n`submodule \ud835\udd5c E` and its `order_dual`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho_Sup_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho_orthogonal_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.mem_orthogonal'", "description": " When a vector is in `K\u15ee`, with the inner product the\nother way round.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho.ge", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho_self", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho_bot_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.orthogonal.complete_space", "description": "In a complete space, the orthogonal complement of any submodule `K` is complete.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.mem_orthogonal_singleton_iff_inner_left", "description": "A vector in `(\ud835\udd5c \u2219 u)\u15ee` is orthogonal to `u`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho.disjoint", "description": "Orthogonal submodules are disjoint.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "submodule.is_ortho.map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name":