"p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.to_arrow", "description": "An element of the fundamental group as an arrow in the fundamental groupoid.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.group", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.from_path", "description": "An element of the fundamental gorup, constructed from a quotient of homotopic paths.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.fundamental_group_mul_equiv_of_path", "description": "Get an isomorphism between the fundamental groups at two points given a path", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.to_path", "description": "An element of the fundamental group as a quotient of homotopic paths.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.fundamental_group_mul_equiv_of_path_connected", "description": "The fundamental group of a path connected space is independent of the choice of basepoint.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group", "description": " The fundamental group is the automorphism group (vertex group) of the basepoint\nin the fundamental groupoid.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "fundamental_group.from_arrow", "description": "An element of the fundamental group, constructed from an arrow in the fundamental groupoid.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.is_pwo.mul", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.add_antidiagonal_min_add_min", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.support_add_antidiagonal_subset_add", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.swap_mem_mul_antidiagonal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.is_pwo_support_add_antidiagonal", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.mul_antidiagonal_min_mul_min", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.mul_antidiagonal", "description": " `finset.mul_antidiagonal_of_is_wf hs ht a` is the set of all pairs of an element in `s` and an\nelement in `t` tha