athlib"}, {"name": "set.image_update_Ioo_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_single_Ioc_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_mul_single_Ico_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.Icc_diff_pi_univ_Ioo_subset", "description": " If `x`, `y`, `x'`, and `y'` are functions `\u03a0 i : \u03b9, \u03b1 i`, then\nthe set difference between the box `[x, y]` and the product of the open intervals `(x' i, y' i)`\nis covered by the union of the following boxes: for each `i : \u03b9`, we take\n`[x, update y i (x' i)]` and `[update x i (y' i), y]`.\n\nE.g., if `x' = x` and `y' = y`, then this lemma states that the difference between a closed box\n`[x, y]` and the corresponding open box `{z | \u2200 i, x i < z i < y i}` is covered by the union\nof the faces of `[x, y]`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_mul_single_Icc_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.Icc_diff_pi_univ_Ioc_subset", "description": " If `x`, `y`, `z` are functions `\u03a0 i : \u03b9, \u03b1 i`, then\nthe set difference between the box `[x, z]` and the product of the intervals `(y i, z i]`\nis covered by the union of the boxes `[x, update z i (y i)]`.\n\nE.g., if `x = y`, then this lemma states that the difference between a closed box\n`[x, y]` and the product of half-open intervals `{z | \u2200 i, x i < z i \u2264 y i}` is covered by the union\nof the faces of `[x, y]` adjacent to `x`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_single_Ioo", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.pi_univ_Ioo_subset", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.piecewise_mem_Icc'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_mul_single_Ico", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_mul_single_Icc_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.image_single_Icc", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "set.pi_univ_Ioc_update_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "squarefre