ap", "description": " The preimage of a Lie subalgebra under a Lie algebra morphism is a Lie subalgebra of the\ndomain.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.hom_of_le_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.coe_bracket", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_equiv.of_subalgebras", "description": " An equivalence of Lie algebras restricts to an equivalence from any Lie subalgebra onto its\nimage.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.span_union", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.mem_of_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_hom.equiv_range_of_injective", "description": "A Lie algebra is equivalent to its range under an injective Lie algebra morphism.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.sub_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.mem_coe_submodule", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_hom.range_eq_map", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.has_Inf", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.has_inf", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.gc_map_comap", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.coe_incl'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.add_eq_sup", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_ring_module", "description": " Given a Lie algebra `L` containing a Lie subalgebra `L' \u2286 L`, together with a Lie ring module\n`M` of `L`, we may regard `M` as a Lie ring module of `L'` by restriction.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.ext_iff'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.equiv_of_le", "description": " Given nested Lie subalgebras `K \u2286 K'`, there is a natural equivalence from `K` to its image in\n`K'`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.mem_inf", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_module_hom.coe_restrict_lie", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_span_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.zero_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.le_def", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.bot_coe_submodule", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.map_le_iff_le_comap", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.subsingleton_bot", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.coe_to_submodule_mk", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.top_coe", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.to_submodule_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_ring", "description": "A Lie subalgebra forms a new Lie ring.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.Inf_glb", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.canonically_ordered_add_monoid", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.coe_set_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.ext", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.smul_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_span_mono", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_module_hom.restrict_lie", "description": " An `L`-equivariant map of Lie modules `M \u2192 N` is `L'`-equivariant for any Lie subalgebra\n`L' \u2286 L`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.coe_injective", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_span", "description": "The Lie subalgebra of a Lie algebra `L` generated by a subset `s \u2286 L`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_subalgebra.lie_algebra", "description": "A Lie subalgebra forms a new Lie algebra.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "lie_equiv.lie_subalgebra_map", "description": " An equivalence of Lie algebras restricts to an equivalence from any Lie subalgebra onto its\nimage.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name"