tween topological spaces `X` and `Y` are a pair of functions\n`to_fun : C(X, Y)` and `inv_fun : C(Y, X)` such that `to_fun.comp inv_fun` and `inv_fun.comp to_fun`\nare both homotopic to `id`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.left_inv", "description": "A homotopy equivalence between topological spaces `X` and `Y` are a pair of functions\n`to_fun : C(X, Y)` and `inv_fun : C(Y, X)` such that `to_fun.comp inv_fun` and `inv_fun.comp to_fun`\nare both homotopic to `id`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.right_inv", "description": "A homotopy equivalence between topological spaces `X` and `Y` are a pair of functions\n`to_fun : C(X, Y)` and `inv_fun : C(Y, X)` such that `to_fun.comp inv_fun` and `inv_fun.comp to_fun`\nare both homotopic to `id`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "homeomorph.coe_to_homotopy_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.simps.apply", "description": " See Note [custom simps projection]. We need to specify this projection explicitly in this case,\nbecause it is a composition of multiple projections.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "homeomorph.refl_to_homotopy_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.trans_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "homeomorph.trans_to_homotopy_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.ext_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.refl_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "homeomorph.symm_to_homotopy_equiv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.coe_inv_fun", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.inhabited", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "continuous_map.homotopy_equiv.symm", "description": "If `X` is homotopy equivalent to `Y`, then `Y` is homotopy equivalent to `X`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "c