space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.open_target", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.base_set", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.open_base_set", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.source_eq", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.target_eq", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.proj_to_fun", "description": " This structure contains the information left for a local trivialization (which is implemented\nbelow as `trivialization F proj`) if the total space has not been given a topology, but we\nhave a topology on both the fiber and the base space. Through the construction\n`topological_fiber_prebundle F proj` it will be possible to promote a\n`pretrivialization F proj` to a `trivialization F proj`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.proj_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.coe_fst", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.preimage_singleton_homeomorph_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.coe_coe_fst", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.target_inter_preimage_symm_source_eq", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.preimage_singleton_homeomorph_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.proj_symm_apply'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.comp_homeomorph", "description": "Composition of a `trivialization` and a `homeomorph`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.mk_proj_snd", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.proj_symm_apply'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.symm_apply_of_not_mem", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.source_homeomorph_base_set_prod", "description": "The source is homeomorphic to the product of the base set with the fiber.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.source_homeomorph_base_set_prod_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.symm", "description": " A fiberwise inverse to `e`. This is the function `F \u2192 E b` that induces a local inverse\n`B \u00d7 F \u2192 total_space F E` of `e` on `e.base_set`. It is defined to be `0` outside `e.base_set`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.mem_source", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.ext_iff", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.coe_fst'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.preimage_homeomorph", "description": "The preimage of a subset of the base set is homeomorphic to the product with the fiber.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.coe_fst_eventually_eq_proj'", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.apply_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.continuous_at_of_comp_left", "description": " Read off the continuity of a function `f : X \u2192 Z` at `x : X` by transferring via a\ntrivialization of `Z` containing `f x`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.apply_symm_apply", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "trivialization.piecewise_le_of_eq", "description": " Given two bundle trivializations `e`, `e'` of a topological fiber bundle `proj : Z \u2192 B`\nover a linearly ordered base `B` and a point `a \u2208 e.base_set \u2229 e'.base_set` such that\n`e` equals `e'` on `proj \u207b\u00b9' {a}`, `e.piecewise_le_of_eq e' a He He' Heq` is the bundle\ntrivialization over `set.ite (Iic a) e.base_set e'.base_set` that is equal to `e` on points `p`\nsuch that `proj p \u2264 a` and is equal to `e'` otherwise.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "pretrivialization.mk_symm", "description":