athlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.balance2_rb", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.find_ins_of_eqv", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.is_searchable_insert", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.mem_of_mem_mk_insert_result", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.ins.induction", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.ins_ne_leaf", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.is_searchable_balance1", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.mem_balance1_node_of_mem_right", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.is_searchable_ins", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.insert_is_red_black", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.mem_balance2_node_of_mem_left", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.of_mem_balance1_node", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.find_red_of_incomp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.balance2_eq\u2081", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.is_searchable_balance2", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.find_mk_insert_result", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.ins_ne_leaf_tac", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "rbnode.mem_balance2_node_of_incomp", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_max_filter.norm_add_same_ray", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a maximum along a filter `l` at a point\n`c` and `y` is a vector on the same ray as `f c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + y\u2016` has a maximul\nalong `l` at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_max_on.norm_add_same_ray", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a maximum on a set `s` at a point `c` and\n`y` is a vector on the same ray as `f c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + y\u2016` has a maximul on `s` at\n`c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_local_max_on.norm_add_same_ray", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a local maximum on a set `s` at a point\n`c` and `y` is a vector on the same ray as `f c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + y\u2016` has a local\nmaximul on `s` at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_local_max_on.norm_add_self", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a local maximum on a set `s` at a point\n`c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + f c\u2016` has a local maximul on `s` at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_max_on.norm_add_self", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a maximum on a set `s` at a point `c`,\nthen the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + f c\u2016` has a maximul on `s` at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_local_max.norm_add_same_ray", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a local maximum at a point `c` and `y` is\na vector on the same ray as `f c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + y\u2016` has a local maximul at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_local_max.norm_add_self", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a local maximum at a point `c`, then the\nfunction `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + f c\u2016` has a local maximul at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "is_max_filter.norm_add_self", "description": " If `f : \u03b1 \u2192 E` is a function such that `norm \u2218 f` has a maximum along a filter `l` at a point\n`c`, then the function `\u03bb x, \u2016f x + f c\u2016` has a maximul along `l` at `c`.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.add_pluennecke_petridis", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_pow_le", "description": "Special case of the **Pl\u00fcnnecke-Ruzsa inequality**. Multiplication version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_add_mul_le_card_add_mul_card_sub", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Add-add-sub version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_sub_mul_le_card_add_mul_card_add", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Sub-add-add version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_nsmul_le", "description": "Special case of the **Pl\u00fcnnecke-Ruzsa inequality**. Addition version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_div_mul_le_card_div_mul_card_div", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Division version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_mul_mul_le_card_div_mul_card_mul", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Mul-div-div version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_div_mul_le_card_mul_mul_card_div", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Sub-add-sub version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_add_mul_le_card_sub_mul_card_add", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Add-sub-sub version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_pow_div_pow_le'", "description": "The **Pl\u00fcnnecke-Ruzsa inequality**. Subtraction version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_mul_mul_card_le_card_mul_mul_card_mul", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Multiplication version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_mul_pow_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_mul_mul_le_card_mul_mul_card_div", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Mul-mul-div version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_nsmul_sub_nsmul_le'", "description": "The **Pl\u00fcnnecke-Ruzsa inequality**. Subtraction version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_div_mul_le_card_mul_mul_card_mul", "description": "**Ruzsa's triangle inequality**. Div-mul-mul version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_nsmul_le'", "description": "Special case of the **Pl\u00fcnnecke-Ruzsa inequality**. Subtraction version.", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_add_nsmul_le", "description": "", "p": "mathlib"}, {"name": "finset.card_pow_div_po